    "rationale": "Relocate AND/OR gates (3,4) to share x=21 column and reduce vertical spacing between layers; move NOT gate (5) to y=25 to vertically align with the new AND/OR row and eliminate the long horizontal detour from (22,26)→(21,29). This compacts internal extent to width=2, height=4 (area=8 tiles), opens a direct vertical channel for edges (3,5) and (5,2), and reduces edge_steps by eliminating the 7-step (1,4) detour and shortening (4,2). Routing order prioritizes reconvergent fanin (3 and 4 before 5 and 2) and places the longest-path edge (4,2) later to avoid blocking critical vertical channels."
